  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Increased capacity of constituents for  enhanced productivity and decent work in the agricultural and textile supply chains</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The ILO promotes the adoption of responsible business conduct (RBC) practices in Syria&#x2019;s textile and garment sector by supporting enterprises and sector institutions based on the guidance of the ILO Tripartite Declaration of Principles concerning Multinational Enterprises and Social Policy. The focus is on strengthening enterprise-level compliance and supply chain practices through advisory services, capacity building, and practical tools.</narrative>
  </description>
